# text = he sent me to emanuel college in cambridge at fourteen years old , where i resided three years , and applied myself close to my studies ; but the charge of maintaining me , although i had a very scanty allowance , being too great for a narrow fortune , i was bound apprentice to mr. james bates , an eminent surgeon in london , with whom i continued four years .
